WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.569
Seth: Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.036
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:05.638
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:09.342
President Biden toured Hurricane
damage today in Florida

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.211
and met with
Governor Ron Desantis.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:14.280
And Desantis has been
working around the clock

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.583
to recover from wearing
this outfit.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:19.519
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:22.087
President Biden tweeted
a picture of himself this week

00:00:22.087 --> 00:00:23.456
in a green sports car.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.225
Oh my God, look at him.

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:26.458
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:29.162
He loves his wife,
yet has the energy of a man

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.030
who was divorced an hour ago.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.431
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.431 --> 00:00:35.702
[ As Biden ] "Got me a hot young
girlfriend, too. She's 65."

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.169
[ Light Laughter ]

00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:39.572
Russian President Vladimir Putin
is reportedly planning

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:42.108
to order a nuclear test
near the border of Ukraine

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:45.445
to demonstrate his willingness
to use nuclear weapons.

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:48.113
Oh, you don't have to
prove you're crazy.

00:00:48.113 --> 00:00:52.384
You ride horses half naked
and your best friend

00:00:52.384 --> 00:00:54.587
is Donald Trump.
We see you.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.088
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:57.557
According to a new report,

00:00:57.557 --> 00:01:00.226
staffers who worked in former
President Trump's White House

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:03.863
were not surprised that in the
raid of his Mar-A-Lago residence

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:06.633
the FBI found
highly-classified materials

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.501
mixed in with news clippings

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.603
because trump never followed
the strict rules

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.338
for handling
sensitive documents.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:13.806
Also, you're not gonna
believe this,

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:17.410
he never separated his trash
from his recycling.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.046
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:22.582
And in a new animated
"Scooby-Doo" Halloween special,

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:26.051
the character Velma Dinkley
will be depicted as LGBTQ.

00:01:26.051 --> 00:01:28.153
Now, you might be thinking,
"What about Fred?"

00:01:28.153 --> 00:01:30.156
But hear me out.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:32.225
Hear me out.

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:34.927
Fred is an overconfident
white guy

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:38.330
who thinks he's a detective
just because he owns a van.

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:41.000
He's definitely straight.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.302
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.170
He probably has
an alt-right podcast

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.939
where he complains
about Velma being gay.

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:48.541
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.376
New York Yankees star
Aaron Judge last night

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.178
hit his 62nd home run
of the season

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.479
breaking --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:57.049
Yeah, give it up for Aaron Judge
breaking Roger Maris'

00:01:57.049 --> 00:01:58.151
American League record,

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.019
And to add insult to injury,

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:02.221
the ball hit a Mets fan
and killed him.

00:02:02.221 --> 00:02:04.257
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:09.028
And you know what the Met's fans
last words were?

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.965
"At least I don't gotta watch us
blow it in the playoffs."

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:14.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:19.339
Al Pacino is reportedly closing
a deal with a publisher

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:20.372
to write a book.

00:02:20.372 --> 00:02:21.741
It will be the first
autobiography

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:23.376
written in all caps.

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:25.411
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.281 --> 00:02:31.484
Very, very unfair photo.

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:32.752
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:32.752 --> 00:02:35.021
But that is his writing face.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.789
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:39.324
According to new reports, prices
for real Christmas trees

00:02:39.324 --> 00:02:40.993
are expected to increase
this year,

00:02:40.993 --> 00:02:44.330
so expect some changes to
Rockefeller Plaza this December.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.366
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:50.870
And finally, according to
a new survey,

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.274
60% of Americans said they have
never cheated on a partner

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:56.475
in a relationship,
and if you have to ask,

00:02:56.475 --> 00:02:58.978
"Does it count if --"
the answer is yes.

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:00.079
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.079 --> 00:03:01.548
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

